  _author: Dooiereier
  _description: 'Jump straight to any part of a large Vizzy program. Tag a comment
    with "//Path/To/Name" and it shows up in a color-coded, nested "Jump to" list
    - select an entry and the canvas pans right to it. Works with no mod installed:
    the tags are just ordinary comments either way. Also checks for updates on
    startup.'
